1
00:00:00,315 --> 00:00:01,815
(Bernadette:)You heard what he said
about his parents.

2
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:04,116
(Bernadette:)It was the little things
they kept bottled up.

3
00:00:04,118 --> 00:00:06,318
(Bernadette:)I don't want that
to happen to us.

4
00:00:06,321 --> 00:00:08,621
