I'm not answering that.

7
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:17,062
(Howard:)It's a trap.

8
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:20,633
So there are things
you don't like.

9
00:00:20,635 --> 00:00:23,365
(Howard:)And here I am in the trap.

10
00:00:25,206 --> 00:00:27,136
(Howard:)You just keep talking.

11
00:00:27,141 --> 00:00:29,541
(Howard:)I'm gonna chew my leg off.

12
00:00:29,544 --> 00:00:31,714
(Bernadette:)Just tell me one thing
that bothers you,

13
00:00:31,713 --> 00:00:33,183
(Bernadette:)and I promise I won't get mad.

14
00:00:33,181 --> 00:00:36,381
(Howard:)Okay. The truth is...

15
00:00:36,384 --> 00:00:38,554
(Howard:)sometimes... you're too...

16
00:00:38,553 --> 00:00:40,553
(Howard:)beautiful.

17
00:00:40,555 --> 00:00:42,325
(Sheldon:)Oh.

18
00:00:42,323 --> 00:00:44,553
(Bernadette:)Howie, be serious.

19
00:00:44,559 --> 00:00:46,559
(Howard:)Okay, okay.

20
00:00:46,561 --> 00:00:49,061
(Howard:)I really don't like

21
00:00:49,063 --> 00:00:51,333
(Howard:)how your wings poke me
when we sleep

22
00:00:51,332 --> 00:00:53,902
(Howard:)'cause you're an angel.

23
00:00:55,503 --> 00:00:57,673
(Bernadette:)Okay, fine,
maybe it was a bad idea.

24
